  "source": "",
  "lolo": "app std-objective-flow \"1.0.0\"\n\"Headless win/lose authority for objective boards: owns only result. Listens PROGRESS (objectivesLeft + movesLeft) and sets result to won when every objective is reached, lost when the move budget runs out first, else none. Renders nothing.\"\norbital ObjectiveFlowOrbital {\n  entity FlowState [runtime, shared] {\n    id : string!\n    result : string = \"none\"\n  }\n\n  trait ObjectiveFlow -> @rebindable FlowState [lifecycle] {\n    initial: active\n\n    state active {\n      INIT -> active\n        (set @entity.result \"none\")\n\n      PROGRESS -> active when @config.running\n        (set @entity.result (if (<= @payload.objectivesLeft 0) \"won\" (if (<= @payload.movesLeft 0) \"lost\" \"none\")))\n        (if (!= @entity.result \"none\") (emit GAME_END { result: @entity.result }) null)\n\n      RESTART -> active\n        (set @entity.result \"none\")\n    }\n\n    emits {\n      GAME_END -> external {\n        result : string!\n      }\n        @description \"Emitted for parity with round-flow when the round resolves; listeners may react to end-of-round\"\n        @tier \"domain\"\n    }\n\n    listens {\n      PROGRESS { objectivesLeft : number, movesLeft : number }\n      RESTART { id : string }\n    }\n\n    config {\n      running : boolean = true\n        @label \"Running\"\n        @description \"When true, PROGRESS signals resolve win/lose; toggle to freeze\"\n        @tier \"domain\"\n    }\n  }\n\n  page \"/objective-flow\" as ObjectiveFlowPage -> ObjectiveFlow\n}\n"
}